          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Pick a capacity: 6, 24, 36 or 48 blades. Send us your gamefarm name, initials, logo or crest. We draw it onto the leather, hand-tool and dye it, and build the case around a fibreglass shell with a velvet-lined interior.</p><p>6-capacity from ₱2,500 · 24-capacity from ₱4,000 · 36-capacity from ₱6,000 · 48-capacity from ₱7,000</p>"
